\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {B.1}{\ignorespaces As Figure~\ref {fig:curves}, for the second design-matrix realisation $X^{(2)}$: training curves across parameter dimension $p$ (rows) and batch size (columns); Monte Carlo (blue) and Rao-Blackwellised (orange), with the Bayes floor $L^{*}(p)$ dashed.}}{60}{figure.caption.37}%
